  "description": "Whilst Melord's body and mind rotted away as he transformed into the terrible Demon of Decay, his soul was the only part of him to retain its divinity. Were one to witness the crystallized form of Melord's soul, one would see a never fading splendor reminiscent of that of a high ranking god. Had his story been different, Melord would have likely distanced himself from his master, , to walk his own path towards further knowledge and wisdom, ultimately becoming a member of the Divine Ten himself.",
